      "updated": 1794678234062,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Loops in stored procedures\nA loop is used when we want to execute a particular block of SQL statements repeatedly until a condition becomes\nfalse or for a fixed number of iterations.\n\nThink of it like a for or while loop in Java.",
      "fontSize": 22.707930367504815,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Loops in stored procedures\nA loop is used when we want to execute a particular block of SQL statements repeatedly until a condition becomes false or for a fixed number of iterations.\n\nThink of it like a for or while loop in Java.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
